OL,3,GNEWSABoil water notice lifted after
OL,4,Aclear bacteria tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in four streets who were
OL,7,Fgiven a boil water notice can now use
OL,8,Ftheir tap water as normal after water
OL,9,Fquality tests came back clear.
OL,11,FAbout 70 homes on Martin Close,
OL,12,FBullfinch Court, Magpie Lane and
OL,13,FChaffinch Way in Lee-on-Solent were
OL,14,Ftold by Portsmouth Water to boil their
OL,15,Fwater on Sunday after a routine test
OL,16,Ffound bacteria in a sample taken from a
OL,17,Ffire hydrant.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
