OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1792574771
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABoil water notice lifted after
OL,4,Aclear bacteria tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt meant residents needed to boil their
OL,7,Fwater before drinking it, brushing
OL,8,Ftheir teeth, washing dishes or giving
OL,9,Fit to pets while further tests were
OL,10,Fcarried out.
OL,12,FThe water firm said the tests had since
OL,13,Fcome back "clear, with no E.coli or
OL,14,Fcoliform bacteria detected, confirming
OL,15,Fthere is no issue with the water
OL,16,Fsupply."
